        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tGIVING TUESDAY\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tDecember 2, 2025\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThis Giving Tuesday, please consider joining the unique community of donors that supports our Theatre Angel program. This program makes ArtSpring more accessible by making twenty $15 tickets available per ArtSpring presents show on a first-come, first-served basis.\nOur hope with the Theatre Angel program is to keep our theatre doors open for everyone, regardless of income. To support our mission, please visit canadahelps.org or purchase.artspring.ca/Donations.\n \nAngel Ticket purchasers have said:\n“The Angel Ticket program makes it possible for me to attend performances I otherwise couldn’t\nafford. It’s wonderful to feel included in the arts community.”\n“As a senior on a fixed income, I’m so grateful for this program. It gives me something to look forward to and keeps me engaged in the arts.”\n“I was able to bring my child to a show we otherwise couldn’t afford. That experience meant so much to us.”\n“This initiative removes financial barriers and allows people from all walks of life to experience high-quality performances.”\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t December 2, 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: ASP-slider\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\