    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BALLET KELONA: Vividus &#8212; Full of Life"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Mon Mar 23, 7:30pm | After opening ArtSpring’s 25th Anniversary season to acclaim, Ballet Kelowna returns with Vividus: Full of Life—a bold, high-energy program featuring three dazzling contemporary works by top Canadian choreographers. Alysa Pires’ Vestigesis a sweeping, cinematic reflection on connection in a chaotic world. The Forever Part by Kirsten Wicklund offers a dreamlike meditation on longing, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
