    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MICHAEL KAESHAMMER"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Thu Mar 19, 7:30pm | He’s back! Beloved by ArtSpring audiences and celebrated worldwide, Michael Kaeshammer is a virtuosic pianist, charismatic performer, and master showman. His concerts are high-octane journeys through jazz, boogie-woogie, pop, and soul—infused with signature charm, playful improvisation, and unstoppable joy. Whether he’s lighting up the keys in a driving rhythm or [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
